sequenceDiagram
    participant Timer as shared vsync timer (UI thread)
    participant FC as frame_clocks (one per output)
    participant UI as tick_ui
    participant SB as snapshot_buffer[slot] (one per output view)
    participant CV as render_cv
    participant RT as render thread
    participant TR as tick_render
    participant KMS as kms_pipeline[slot] (one per CRTC)

    loop each wakeup (earliest start among running clocks)
        Timer->>UI: on_vsync()
        UI->>FC: take_due(now): outputs due within 1 ms
        UI->>UI: wayland.dispatch + scene.update
        UI->>SB: commit_frame(slot, frame) for each due output with damage
        UI->>CV: render_mask |= published; notify render_pending
        CV->>RT: wake
        RT->>TR: tick_render()
        TR->>SB: acquire_render_snapshot(slot) for each bit of render_mask
        TR->>KMS: composite + nonblocking commit per output<br/>(first frames: one combined commit_modeset)
        KMS-->>UI: flip event (routed by CRTC): clocks.on_present(slot),<br/>feedback and frame callbacks of that output
    end
